{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43255","headline":"送薛大夫和蕃 · 孙頠","name":"送薛大夫和蕃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亚相独推贤，乘轺向远边。\n一心倾汉日，万里望胡天。\n忠信皇恩重，要荒圣德传。\n戎人方屈膝，塞月复婵娟。\n别思流莺晚，归朝候雁先。\n当书外垣传，回奏赤墀前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙頠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}